\begin_layout Plain Layout
The code below calculates the time dynamics of 
\begin_inset Formula $\ket{\psi\left(t\right)}$
\end_inset

 using a FOR loop.
 At each time step,
 we extract the polarization,
 
\begin_inset Formula $-\Braket{\mathbf{Z}}$
\end_inset

,
 and the total energy,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\Braket{\hat{H}}$
\end_inset

.
